                                "example_id": "3ca1c56a-4920-4e82-b2f4-44047172c48c",
                                "sense_id": "da4123ba-9b7a-3e36-89e4-e01bbc78b6ff",
                                "text": "Aquatic birds of various kinds are very numerous, such as geese, darters (Flotus melanogaster), scissor-bills (Rhynchops nigra), adjutants (Leptoptilos argala), pelicans, cormorants, cranes (Grus antigone, in Burmese gyoja), whimbrels, plovers, and ibises."
                            }
                        ]
